  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "0001",
      "time": "2026-10-19 00:23:10",
      "summary": "Add model code: Engram port, GDN mixer, attention/SWA/linear-attention mixers, full model, vendored references",
      "explanation": "New package engramdelta.models. engram.py ports DeepSeek's engram_demo_v1.py (hash, prime tables, multi-head embedding, gating, dilated short conv) to hc_mult=1 with torch-side hashing. gdn_block.py reimplements FLA's GatedDeltaNet layer with a switchable core (FLA Triton kernel or a pure-PyTorch chunked delta rule using solve_triangular) plus a recurrent reference that captures states for analysis. model.py assembles arms A1-A6, T1, T2, LA from one config, computes loss only at loss positions (answers + lambda-weighted filler), counts parameters (embedding vs non-embedding) and matches MLP width for parameter matching. third_party/ holds the unchanged reference files with licenses and provenance.",
