    {
      "id": "0002",
      "time": "2026-10-19 00:27:12",
      "summary": "Add MQAR/LM data, evaluation (recall, state occupancy, LM buckets/copy loss) and DDP/checkpoint/logging/config utilities",
      "explanation": "data/mqar.py generates MQAR with clutter placements a/b from a fixed phrase pool, per-sequence key-value resampling, answer + filler-next-token targets, and step-seeded deterministic streams; data/lm_data.py serves rank-strided deterministic windows from uint16 memmaps. eval/ adds DDP-sharded MQAR recall, GDN state effective-rank/Frobenius/spectrum via the recurrent reference, beta/alpha stats per token category, and LM eval with position buckets and the in-context-copy mask. utils/ adds idempotent torchrun/DDP setup with a parameter-sync guard, atomic checkpoints with per-rank RNG, immutable read-only result JSON, optional HF Hub sync, and YAML configs with inheritance and dotted overrides.",
