    {
      "id": "0003",
      "time": "2026-10-19 11:44:57",
      "summary": "Add training (synchronized DDP), sweep/manifest/budget tooling, checks, data prep, evals and analysis",
      "explanation": "train.py runs one MQAR or LM run under torchrun with DDP gradient all-reduce, no_sync accumulation, fp16 GradScaler, cosine LR, parameter-sync guard, atomic resumable checkpoints, time-limit exit code 3 and immutable result JSON. make_manifest.py encodes the exact experiment groups E0.3-E2.2 and resolves prereg 'auto' values by pre-registered rules; sweep.py runs manifests with skip-if-done and a session budget; budget.py estimates GPU-hours from measured throughput. ddp_check/nccl_smoke/bench_kernels implement the Phase 0 DDP, NCCL and kernel tests; prepare_lm_data/eval_lm/run_state_metrics/sync cover Phase 2 data, LM eval, state metrics and HF Hub sync; analysis.py and make_plots.py produce tables, rule checks and figures without interpretation.",
