      "summary": "Add per-arm YAML configs for phases 0-2 and the machine-readable pre-registration",
      "explanation": "phase1/base.yaml fixes the MQAR task and the d=128, 2-block, 4x32-head GDN model with Engram at block 1 (2.4k rows/head); each arm file (A1-A6, T1, H4 variants) is a small override, with match_nonembed_of: A2 for arms without Engram. phase0 inherits phase1 with F=0 and adds LA. phase2 defines the d=384, 8-block LM with Engram at blocks 1 and 3 (14.7k rows/head), A1/A2/A3/A5/T1/T2. prereg.yaml holds N_star, phase1_steps, LRs and Phase 2 tokens, to be filled after Phase 0.",
